	<title>[OpenAI] 悲， ChatGPT Web 被路由到 5.5mini 了，弱智得流口水</title>
	<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236623#reply6" />
	<id>tag:www.v2ex.com,2026-08-23:/t/1236623</id>
